```

## Emergency Procedures

### Rollback Release
1. Identify last working version
2. Revert `versions.json` to previous version
3. Run `npm run version:sync`
4. Force push to main (with notification)
5. Monitor deployment

### Fix Production Bug
1. Assess severity
2. Create hotfix branch if critical
3. Delegate fix to appropriate agent
4. Fast-track through quality gates
5. Deploy immediately

### Content Corruption
1. Run `npm run assets:map` to identify issues
2. Check git history for last working state
3. Delegate to Content Manager for repair
4. Regenerate assets
5. Validate graph structure

